    "melodic_leap": 17,
    "rapid_leap": 9
  },
  "technical_note": "Most bass bars divide into three sixteenths, one sixteenth and two eighths. Keep that written pulse supple under the upper ties in bars 3\u20134 and 15\u201316. Both hands breathe in bars 6 and 12. The final two bars sustain one chord without repeating it.",
